      "message": "[error] Line 1291: 🔴 This condition does not hold for the normal one-to-one repository state. `repository_-\u003emembers()` includes the local account (its certificate is scanned from `admins`), and the candidate loop above does not exclude `userId_`, so the initial rotation can track both the local URI and the peer. When the peer\u0027s devices are exhausted, erasing it leaves the local URI in `trackedMembers_`, making this `empty()` check false; the peer is never re-tracked and the reported outage remains. Exclude the local URI from rotation candidates or test for the absence of any non-local tracked member before re-adding `memberUri`, and add a regression test for this path.",
